 wl-clipboard,
 xclip,
 x11-utils,
 dbus-user-session,
 udev,
 kmod,
 passwd,
Description: Lightweight push-to-hold voice input for Linux
 Headless user-session service. Hold right Ctrl to record, release to
 paste Doubao ASR text into the active application. The optional login
 helper uses an installed Chrome/Chromium browser. Status feedback uses
 D-Bus StatusNotifierItem or desktop notifications without GTK bindings.
 .
 Python and its dependencies are bundled. No Python, pip or uv setup is
 required on the target system. Enable the systemd user service to start
 voice input automatically at login.
